{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our lives are shaped by our choices - choices based upon the world around us. Life does not exist in a vacuum; there are always influences, and there are always options. At times, they are few; at others, they are overwhelming. We cannot always see what the outcome might be. But there is always a choice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each moment of our lives is a chance, an instant of possibility... a nexus. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You stand at a crossroads of destiny - which path will you follow?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nexus: The Zoraidian Oracle is a solitaire card game with three distinct purposes - to entertain you, to relax you, and to challenge your strategic and critical thinking skills - based upon whatever your frame of mind desires it to be. Inspired by Hanafuda, a traditional Japanese flower card game, Nexus is a versatile diversion for the mind and the spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique deck of 144 cards, encompassing both a Lesser and a Greater Arcana, Nexus has been described as an intriguing cross between gin rummy and the Tarot. </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Anar's Prototype","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3734740/0d8ef4228c4c47df1d20a67b28af148821b6d5be.jpg"},{"name":"Apocalyptic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3734740/0d8ef4228c4c47df1d20a67b28af148821b6d5be.jpg"},{"name":"Artisan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3734740/0d8ef4228c4c47df1d20a67b28af148821b6d5be.jpg"},{"name":"Clairvoyant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3734740/0d8ef4228c4c47df1d20a67b28af148821b6d5be.jpg"},{"name":"Combat Medic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3734740/0d8ef4228c4c47df1d20a67b28af148821b6d5be.jpg"},{"name":"Cultist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3734740/0d8ef4228c4c47df1d20a67b28af148821b6d5be.jpg"},{"name":"Disciple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3734740/0d8ef4228c4c47df1d20a67b28af148821b6d5be.jpg"},{"name":"Doomsayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3734740/0d8ef4228c4c47df1d20a67b28af148821b6d5be.jpg"},{"name":"Dreamslayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3734740/0d8ef4228c4c47df1d20a67b28af148821b6d5be.jpg"},{"name":"Eternal Wanderer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3734740/0d8ef4228c4c47df1d20a67b28af148821b6d5be.jpg"}],"total":98},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734740?t=1752106064","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734740?t=1752106064","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734740/f164ab4bd2aa5ed771b537f225343366f08c0877/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752106064","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734740/f164ab4bd2aa5ed771b537f225343366f08c0877/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752106064","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3779840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our lives are shaped by our choices - choices based upon the world around us. Life does not exist in a vacuum; there are always influences, and there are always options. At times, they are few; at others, they are overwhelming. We cannot always see what the outcome might be. But there is always a choice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each moment of our lives is a chance, an instant of possibility... a nexus. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You stand at a crossroads of destiny - which path will you follow?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nexus: The Zoraidian Oracle is a solitaire card game with three distinct purposes - to entertain you, to relax you, and to challenge your strategic and critical thinking skills - based upon whatever your frame of mind desires it to be. Inspired by Hanafuda, a traditional Japanese flower card game, Nexus is a versatile diversion for the mind and the spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique deck of 144 cards, encompassing both a Lesser and a Greater Arcana, Nexus has been described as an intriguing cross between gin rummy and the Tarot. </p>","developers":["Aetheric Worlds, LLC"],"dlc":[3779630,3735930],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734740/8154bbb6bea405929aac5217d06de9060dead1e0/header.jpg?t=1752106064","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3734740/1571190595/125082a711c19f1e3c2248abae845922b4e1d02e/1750430106/dash_